#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"To learn about other Tor bridges, you have several options listed below."
msgstr ""
"Per conèixer altres ponts de Tor, teniu diverses opcions que s'enumeren a "
"continuació."

#. type: Plain text
msgid "You can use *obfs4* and *WebTunnel* bridges in Tails right now."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<div class=\"tip\">\n"
"<p>None of these options is easy to do from Tails, so we recommend that you\n"
"learn about several bridges from your regular computer <i>before starting\n"
"Tails</i> and store the bridge lines in a text document on separate USB\n"
"stick.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"tip\">\n"
"<p>Cap d'aquestes opcions és fàcil de fer des de Tails, així que us "
"recomanem que\n"
"descobriu diversos ponts des del vostre ordinador habitual <i>abans d'"
"arrencar\n"
"Tails</i> i guardeu les línies del pont en un document de text en un altre "
"llapis\n"
"USB.</p>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<p>After you restarted on Tails, you can copy one of these bridge lines from\n"
"this other USB stick into <i>Tor Connection</i>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Després de reiniciar Tails, podeu copiar una d'aquestes línies de pont\n"
"d'aquest altre llapis USB a <i>Connexió Tor</i>.</p>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</div>\n"
msgstr "</div>\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"Even someone who knows your bridge cannot know what you are doing online "
"from Tails."
msgstr ""
"Fins i tot algú que conegui el vostre pont no pot saber què feu en línia des "
"de Tails."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "**Website**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can visit <https://bridges.torproject.org/options>.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    We recommend doing so from a different\n"
#| "    local network if you want to hide that you are connecting to Tor.\n"
msgid ""
"  We recommend doing so from a different\n"
"  local network if you want to hide that you are connecting to Tor.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Recomanem fer-ho des d'una altra\n"
"    xarxa local si voleu ocultar que us esteu connectant a Tor.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "**Email**"
msgstr "**Correu electrònic**"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    You can send an empty email to\n"
#| "    <a href=\"mailto:bridges@torproject.org\">bridges@torproject.org</a> from a\n"
#| "    Gmail or Riseup email address.\n"
msgid ""
"  You can send an empty email to\n"
"  <a href=\"mailto:bridges@torproject.org\">bridges@torproject.org</a> from a\n"
"  Gmail or Riseup email address.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Podeu enviar un correu electrònic buit a\n"
"    <a href=\"mailto:bridges@torproject.org\">bridges@torproject.org</a> des d'una\n"
"    adreça de correu electrònic de Gmail o Riseup.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    Sending the email reveals to Gmail or Riseup that you are trying to\n"
#| "    connect to Tor but not to someone who monitors your Internet connection.\n"
msgid ""
"  Sending the email reveals to Gmail or Riseup that you are trying to\n"
"  connect to Tor but not to someone who monitors your Internet connection.\n"
msgstr ""
"    L'enviament del correu electrònic revela a Gmail o Riseup que esteu intentant\n"
"    connecteu-vos a Tor però no a algú que controli la vostra connexió a Internet.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "**Telegram**"
msgstr "**Telegram**"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    You can send the message `/bridges` to\n"
#| "    [@GetBridgesBot](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot) on *Telegram*.\n"
msgid ""
"  You can send the message `/bridges` to\n"
"  [@GetBridgesBot](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot) on *Telegram*.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Podeu enviar el missatge `/bridges` a\n"
"    [@GetBridgesBot](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot) a *Telegram*.\n"

#~ msgid "**CAPTCHA**"
#~ msgstr "**CAPTCHA**"

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "    You can solve a CAPTCHA on [https://bridges.torproject.org/](https://bridges.torproject.org/bridges?transport=obfs4).\n"
#~ msgstr "    Podeu resoldre un CAPTCHA a [https://bridges.torproject.org/](https://bridges.torproject.org/bridges?transport=obfs4).\n"
